{"id":"wb-5-322","name":"寿县古城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"寿县古城墙","text":"寿县古城墙，位于安徽省淮南市寿县，是中国如今仍保存完好的古代城墙之一、全国重点文物保护单位之一。寿县城墙有四门，东门称为宾阳，南称为通淝，西门称为定湖，北门称为靖淮。而四门的瓮城也依然保存。\n寿县曾在历史上是十分重要的军事重镇。而寿县又非常容易遭受淮河泛滥，所以在历史上寿县城墙一直都在不断整修中。在1991年的洪灾中寿县古城内一度安置有10余万灾民。现存城墙为南宋时重筑，现今还可以看到“建康”等墙砖字样。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%BF%E5%8E%BF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":92171257,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92171257","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b17636bb3d4702b23c64b85e.jpg","title":"Tongfei_Gate,_Shou_County.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tongfei_Gate,_Shou_County.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/Tongfei_Gate%2C_Shou_County.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Whisper of the heart","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​Tongfei Gate, Shou County City Wall","width":320,"height":240}}